343	Model & Condition & Wiki PPL$\downarrow$ & ARC-c$\uparrow$ & MMLU$\uparrow$ & KL--BCE gap \\
344	\midrule
345	Llama 3.1 8B & Dense & 6.12 & 53.4 & 65.3 & --- \\
346	Llama 3.1 8B & KL-only & 9.53 & 51.5 & 63.0 & 2.03 \\
